# E-02 AS-IS architecture evidence commands

Run from `HACKATHON/`.

## AI/local Decision Engine -> canonical DecisionEvent

```bash
nl -ba AI/core/decision_engine/schemas.py | sed -n '104,137p'
```

## DecisionEvent -> Backend REST ingestion boundary

```bash
nl -ba SE/BE/app/modules/ai_alerts/router.py | sed -n '25,45p;154,181p'
```

## Backend alert boundary -> Fleet Dashboard live/saved context

```bash
grep -RInE 'api/v1/alerts|saved_trips|runtime_status|completed|DecisionEvent' SE/FE/src SE/FE/server.ts | head -120
```

## Backend alert/live snapshot -> CarSky mapper

```bash
nl -ba SE/BE/app/integrations/carsky/mapper.py | sed -n '87,214p'
```

## CarSky mapper -> CarSky REST Signal API

```bash
grep -RInE 'actuate|/api/v1/signals|vehicle-speed-mux|Authorization|Bearer|enqueue' SE/BE/app/integrations/carsky SE/BE/tests/test_carsky.py
```

## CarSky Signal Broker/KUKSA Vehicle.Speed -> HMI Bridge Script Node

```bash
nl -ba SE/BE/carsky/dms_hmi_bridge_speed_passthrough.lua | sed -n '1,80p'
```

## HMI Bridge -> Android VHAL PERF_VEHICLE_SPEED

```bash
grep -RInE '291504647|0x11600207|PERF_VEHICLE_SPEED|DMS_HMI_SPEED_MUX' SE/BE/carsky SE/HMI/app/src/main/java SE/HMI/README.md
```

## Android VHAL -> Android HMI APK UI

```bash
nl -ba SE/HMI/app/src/main/java/vn/fpt/dms/hmi/MainActivity.java | sed -n '27,55p;320,405p;660,690p'
```

## Backend/FE -> AI Copilot Report -> Word/DOC artifact

```bash
nl -ba SE/FE/server.ts | sed -n '925,990p'; nl -ba SE/FE/src/components/CopilotFleetReportPage.tsx | sed -n '1115,1235p'
```
